-1. Declare `hypodoc.capability/v1` with renderer identity, renderer version,
-   accepted Spec range, IR versions, Pandoc API versions, profiles, features,
-   and extensions.
-2. Negotiate before rendering. Unsupported schema, Spec, IR, Pandoc API,
-   profile, or feature subsets fail closed in the runtime-defined order.
