+   versions, and Pandoc API versions.
+2. Validate compatibility before rendering. A reference IR consumer uses the
+   defined negotiation order. An independent implementation must provide an
+   equivalent fail-closed boundary for unsupported Spec, profile, feature, and
+   extension subsets.
+3. A reference IR consumer treats `document` and `semantic_nodes` as canonical
+   semantics and `compatibility_extensions` only as namespaced, optional data.
+   An independent implementation compares a documented semantic projection to
